{"yaTasanKyamanudesaH samanam": [{"id": "yaTAsaMKyamanudeSaH samAnAm", "headword": "यथासंख्यमनुदेशः समानाम्", "headword_slp1": "yaTAsaMKyamanudeSaH samAnAm", "fold": "yaTasanKyamanudesaH samanam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "When a rule involves the case of equal numbers of substitutes and of things for which these are to be substituted, their mutual correspondence or assignment of each to each, is according to the order of enumeration.\n\nTerms:", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यथासंख्यमनुदेशः समानाम् १.३.१०", "१.३.१०", "१.३.१० यथासंख्यमनुदेशः समानाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaTAsaMKyamanudeSaH samAnAm १.३.१०", "१.३.१०", "१.३.१० yaTAsaMKyamanudeSaH samAnAm"]}], "yaTasadfye": [{"id": "yaTA'sAdfye", "headword": "यथाऽसादृये", "headword_slp1": "yaTA'sAdfye", "fold": "yaTasadfye", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The indeclinable word यथा when it does not signify 'likeness' is invariably compounded with a word ending in a case-affix which is in construction with it and the compound is called अव्ययीभाव समास।\n\nTerms: अव्ययीभाव समास", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यथाऽसादृये २.१.७", "२.१.७", "२.१.७ यथाऽसादृये"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaTA'sAdfye २.१.७", "२.१.७", "२.१.७ yaTA'sAdfye"]}], "yaTaviDyanuprayogaH purvasmin": [{"id": "yaTAviDyanuprayogaH pUrvasmin", "headword": "यथाविध्यनुप्रयोगः पूर्वस्मिन्", "headword_slp1": "yaTAviDyanuprayogaH pUrvasmin", "fold": "yaTaviDyanuprayogaH purvasmin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In the first case -- क्रियासमभिहारे लोट्, लोटो हिस्वौ, वा च तध्वमोः ३.४.२ the same verb must be used in the subsequent clause, as the verb which was put in the लोट् (Imperative Mood) .\n\nTerms: लोट्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यथाविध्यनुप्रयोगः पूर्वस्मिन् ३.४.४", "३.४.४", "३.४.४ यथाविध्यनुप्रयोगः पूर्वस्मिन्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaTAviDyanuprayogaH pUrvasmin ३.४.४", "३.४.४", "३.४.४ yaTAviDyanuprayogaH pUrvasmin"]}], "yaTataTayorasuyaprativacane": [{"id": "yaTAtaTayorasUyAprativacane", "headword": "यथातथयोरसूयाप्रतिवचने", "headword_slp1": "yaTAtaTayorasUyAprativacane", "fold": "yaTataTayorasuyaprativacane", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix णमुल् is added to the root कृ 'to make', the words 1. यथा 2. तथा being compounded with it when an angry reply is made (if the omission of कृञ् is unobjectionable).\n\nTerms: णमुल्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यथातथयोरसूयाप्रतिवचने ३.४.२८", "३.४.२८", "३.४.२८ यथातथयोरसूयाप्रतिवचने"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaTAtaTayorasUyAprativacane ३.४.२८", "३.४.२८", "३.४.२८ yaTAtaTayorasUyAprativacane"]}], "yaTamuKasanmuKasya darsanaH KaH": [{"id": "yaTAmuKasaMmuKasya darSanaH KaH", "headword": "यथामुखसंमुखस्य दर्शनः खः", "headword_slp1": "yaTAmuKasaMmuKasya darSanaH KaH", "fold": "yaTamuKasanmuKasya darsanaH KaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix ख (ईन) and खञ् comes in the sense of 'a mirror' after the words 1. यथामुख and 2. संमुख being in Genitive 6th-Case in construction.\n\nTerms: ख (ईन) and खञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यथामुखसंमुखस्य दर्शनः खः ५.२.६", "५.२.६", "५.२.६ यथामुखसंमुखस्य दर्शनः खः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaTAmuKasaMmuKasya darSanaH KaH ५.२.६", "५.२.६", "५.२.६ yaTAmuKasaMmuKasya darSanaH KaH"]}], "yaTataTayaTapurayoH paryayeRa": [{"id": "yaTAtaTayaTApurayoH paryAyeRa", "headword": "यथातथयथापुरयोः पर्यायेण", "headword_slp1": "yaTAtaTayaTApurayoH paryAyeRa", "fold": "yaTataTayaTapurayoH paryayeRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "Before a तद्धित affix having an indicatory ञ् , ण् or क् , the words यथातथ and यथापुर may have वृद्धि of the first vowel of their first member or that of the second member, in alteration.\n\nTerms: वृद्धि", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यथातथयथापुरयोः पर्यायेण ७.३.३१", "७.३.३१", "७.३.३१ यथातथयथापुरयोः पर्यायेण"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaTAtaTayaTApurayoH paryAyeRa ७.३.३१", "७.३.३१", "७.३.३१ yaTAtaTayaTApurayoH paryAyeRa"]}], "yaTasve yaTayaTam": [{"id": "yaTAsve yaTAyaTam", "headword": "यथास्वे यथायथम्", "headword_slp1": "yaTAsve yaTAyaTam", "fold": "yaTasve yaTayaTam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The word यथायथम् is irregularly formed in the sense of 'respectively, fitly, properly'.\n\nTerms: Doubling of Words", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["यथास्वे यथायथम् ८.१.१४", "८.१.१४", "८.१.१४ यथास्वे यथायथम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["yaTAsve yaTAyaTam ८.१.१४", "८.१.१४", "८.१.१४ yaTAsve yaTAyaTam"]}]}